[N 35-36 Desolace]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Desolace from Nijel's Point: the road in through Stonetalon, the Reclaimers and Vahlarriel chains, Thunder Axe Fortress, Azore's sceptre and book, the Gizelton caravan, the Kodo Graveyard, Melizza's escort and the Twisted Air Totems, the Valley of Spears ghosts and ravagers, and the Scarlet Monastery lead-in.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 35|r  -  this chapter wants level 34: Down the Scarlet Path (261), Get Me Out of Here! (6132) and Ghost-o-plasm Round Up (6134) need 34, Bone Collector 33, Gizelton Caravan 32. Under 34: legs 1-5 need nothing more, so play them in order; if Brother Anton will not give 261 yet, take it at the Nijel's Point hand-ins after Thunder Axe. The west camp and the Valley of Spears are the hardest ground (Maraudine 36-40, Ravagers 37-38, Spectres 38-39, Outcast Necromancers 39-40): at 35-36 pull one target at a time there
[OC]|cffffffffDesolace|r  -  you start in Theramore after chapter 32, hearth = Theramore. Nijel's Point's flight path is not known yet, so the first trip is by road from Astranaar; then bind at Nijel's Point. About 46,000 quest XP from 19 hand-ins; every kill target here is a normal (not elite) mob
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Reclaimers' Business in Desolace (1453, from Roetten in chapter 27) is handed in on arrival. Shaman: Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358) wants its 5 Twisted Air Totems here
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r no trainer of any kind in Desolace; Eldrun's next ranks wait for Ironforge: chapter 34 ends there and chapter 35 opens at Eldrun

[OC]|cffffffffThe road in|r  -  Astranaar is the flight path you always have; from there the chapter-20 cave leads into Stonetalon. The road through Stonetalon and into Desolace is not in the data: the points below are the cave, the Charred Vale and Nijel's Point, the way between them is unverified. Keep clear of Sun Rock Retreat (Horde)
At [TAR4321 Baldruc], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Astranaar]|r (the game routes it through Auberdine) [G67.5,51.3 Dustwallow Marsh]
Ride south-west from Astranaar to the cave mouth near Alonso and run through it into Stonetalon Mountains [G42.3,71.0 Ashenvale]
[OC]If you took Stonetalon Peak's flight path in chapter 20, fly there instead ([TAR4407 Teloren], 36.4,7.2 Stonetalon Mountains) and ride south to the Charred Vale
Ride west through Stonetalon to the Charred Vale, where the Burning Ravagers and Destroyers (24-27, grey) roam (route unverified) [G30.6,65.7 Stonetalon Mountains]
[OC]Leave the Charred Vale south into Desolace and follow the road to Nijel's Point in the north-east of the zone (the Desolace-side point of the road is unverified)
At flight master [TAR6706 Baritanas Skyriver], get the [P Nijel's Point] flight path [G64.7,10.5 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffNijel's Point|r  -  bind, then the pickups; every giver stands within 6 units of the flight master
At [TAR11103 Innkeeper Lyshaerya], bind your Hearthstone to [S Nijel's Point] (it stays here for chapter 34) [G66.3,6.5 Desolace]
At [TAR5638 Kreldig Ungor], [QT1453] (1,300 XP) [QA1454 The Karnitol Shipwreck] (3,000 XP: find Karnitol's Chest on the west coast) [G66.2,9.6 Desolace]
At [TAR5642 Vahlarriel Demonslayer], [QA1437 Vahlarriel's Search] (1,950 XP: search the Malem wagon) [G66.4,11.8 Desolace]
At [TAR1182 Brother Anton], [QA261 Down the Scarlet Path] (3,000 XP + 45s, requires level 34: 30 Undead Ravagers in the Valley of Spears, the last leg) [G66.5,7.9 Desolace]
[OC]|cffffcc00Cooking:|r Janet Hommers sells two skill-up recipes. Filler only (the food thread stays Mithril Head Trout); buy them if you have the skill and the silver
[O]At [TAR8150 Janet Hommers], [V] buy Recipe: Mystery Stew (30s) (Cooking 175; +5 Sta well fed) [G66.2,6.6 Desolace]
[O]At [TAR8150 Janet Hommers], [V] buy Recipe: Heavy Kodo Stew (70s) (Cooking 200; +10 Sta well fed; needs Heavy Kodo Meat from the Kodo Graveyard kodos) [G66.2,6.6 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffThe Malem wagon|r  -  a short loop west and back: Vahlarriel's next two quests need the pendant handed in first (about 13 units each way)
Search the Malem Chest at the wagon west of town [QT1437] [QA1465 Vahlarriel's Search] (1,950 XP: the Malem Pendant to Vahlarriel) [G56.5,17.8 Desolace]
At [TAR5642 Vahlarriel Demonslayer], [QT1465] [QA1438 Vahlarriel's Search] (2,650 XP: find Dalinda Malem in Thunder Axe Fortress) [QA97284 Vahlarriel's Vengeance] (2,650 XP + 65s: 4 each of Burning Blade Augurs, Reavers, Adepts and Felsworn at Thunder Axe Fortress; new in Forever, she offers it once the pendant is handed in - if she already gave it to you on arrival, nothing changes) [G66.4,11.8 Desolace]

