Kill [TAR4663 Burning Blade Augur], [TAR4664 Burning Blade Reaver], [TAR4665 Burning Blade Adept] and [TAR4666 Burning Blade Felsworn], 4 of each [QC97284] [G54.8,27.9 Desolace]
