At [TAR5644 Dalinda Malem], [QT1439] [QA1440 Return to Vahlarriel] (3,300 XP: escort her out of the fortress, then Vahlarriel) [G54.9,26.1 Desolace]
Escort Dalinda out of Thunder Axe Fortress and stay beside her until the quest completes (the end point is not in the data: "out of the fortress" per the quest text) [QC1440] [G54.9,26.1 Desolace]

[OC]|cffffffffAzore's book|r  -  back west to the tower, then north to the Serpent Statue. Lord Kragaru (38) is not elite; Slitherblade naga (33-36) stand around the statue and a Tide Priestess at 29.4,6.0. Whether the statue needs a swim is unverified
At [TAR11863 Azore Aldamort], [QT5741] [QA6027 Book of the Ancients] (3,550 XP: he gives you the Gem of the Serpent) [G38.9,27.2 Desolace]
